  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0 - Initial Release\n\t\t\t- Auto-detect Test/Production environments from configuration\n\t\t\t- Environment variable-based credential management\n\t\t\t- Support for SELECT queries (DataTable/DataSet)\n\t\t\t- Support for INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE commands\n\t\t\t- Support for scalar queries with type casting\n\t\t\t- Parameterized query support for SQL injection protection\n\t\t\t- Connection pooling and reuse\n\t\t\t- Custom StarburstException with query context\n\t\t\t- SSL/TLS secure connections\n\t\t\t- Full XML documentation for IntelliSense",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Helper library for Starburst data warehouse queries with automatic Test/Production environment switching.",
